OL,3,GNEWSARunner dies after taking part in
OL,4,ACardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA runner has died after taking part in
OL,7,FCardiff Half Marathon.
OL,9,FEvent organisers Run4Wales said on
OL,10,FMonday that the participant had died,
OL,11,Fadding: "We'd like to acknowledge the
OL,12,Fevent and hospital medical teams who
OL,13,Freacted with great speed and
OL,14,Fprofessionalism.
OL,16,F"Our deepest sympathies go out to the
OL,17,Frunner's family and friends."
OL,19,FIt said no further details would be
OL,20,Freleased "in respect of the family's
OL,21,Fwishes".
